{"version":1,"key":"quest:124","content":{"id":124,"title":"focusin/focusout 事件什么时候会触发，和 focus/blur 事件的区别是什么？","summary":"暂未记录答案","target":{"key":"quest:124","type":"quest","id":124},"groupId":2,"groupTitle":"前端","groupColor":"mint-green","status":"resolved","answers":[],"materials":[{"index":1,"kind":"card","group":"note","title":"focus/blur 与 focusin/focusout 的区别","meta":"","excerpt":"当一个元素获得焦点是会触发 focusin 和 focus 事件，而当一个元素失去焦点时会触发 focusout 和 blur 事件。 假设当前聚焦在元素 A，然后将焦点聚焦到了 B，那么触发的顺序是 blur(A) -> focusout(A) -> focus(B) -> focusout(B) 二者的核心区别就在","target":{"key":"card:656","type":"card","id":656},"citeKey":"card:656"}],"trail":[{"time":1767244223323,"tone":"start","text":"提出问题","refs":[]},{"time":1767256414671,"tone":"milestone","text":"写下卡片","refs":[1]},{"time":1767256414673,"tone":"done","text":"标为已解决","refs":[]}],"description":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"createTime":1767244223323,"updateTime":1767244223323,"resolvedTime":1767256414673},"meta":{"type":"quest","publishTime":1767244223323}}